==English==

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[go]] [[against the grain]]}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[defy]] [[convention]]; to do something in a manner that is [[unusual]] or [[out of the ordinary]].
#: ''His method certainly '''goes against the grain''', but it is unquestionably effective.''

